le drain couldn't produce that in a multi-threaded process (secondary arena). The child now drains both chunk classes and releases two blocks from deep in the heap. This incidentally cross-checks `sizeof(Result) == 40` between C and Rust.\n\n`c_src/` was not modified (only `c_src/build/` was created, as instructed).","ttft_ms":2728,"ttft_stream_ms":2579,"time_to_request_ms":70,"type":"result","duration_ms":2213320,"uuid":"7eb523c7-eecf-41dd-b52e-4eeff765829e","queued_turn_count":0}
